locale "zh_hant"

section "addon-checker-revised/options"
t("Token colors", "棋子顏色", "_t")
t("Creature tokens", "怪物棋子", "_t")
t("Use tokens for verified creature identities. Unknown creatures and unsupported appearances keep their native art. This setting is independent of terrain and HUD style, takes effect immediately, and is saved for future games.", "為已確認身分的怪物使用棋子。未知怪物和未涵蓋的外觀保留原版圖像。此設定獨立於地形和介面風格，立即生效，並儲存供以後遊戲使用。", "_t")
t("Enabled", "啟用", "_t")
t("Disabled", "停用", "_t")
t("Player token", "玩家棋子", "_t")
t("Show your main character as a neutral token chosen by race body and sex. It does not follow equipment or class. Shapeshifts, custom tiles and uncovered races keep their native appearance. Creature tokens must also be enabled. This setting takes effect immediately and is saved for future games.", "以按種族體型和性別選定的中性棋子顯示你的主角。棋子不隨裝備或職業變化。變形、自訂貼圖和未涵蓋的種族保留原版外觀。需同時啟用怪物棋子。此設定立即生效，並儲存供以後遊戲使用。", "_t")
t("Board terrain", "棋盤地形", "_t")
t("Native", "原版", "_t")
t("Blockout", "簡化", "_t")
t("Refined", "精修", "_t")
t("Cycle Native, Blockout and Refined terrain. Refined supports Trollmire, Old Forest, Slazish Fens, both Rhaloren Camp layouts, Dreadfell, both Norgos' Lair layouts, both Daikara layouts, The Maze, Heart of the Gloom, Sandworm Lair, Ritches Tunnels, The Deep Bellow, Last Hope Graveyard, Scintillating Caves, Unremarkable Cave, Unknown tunnels, Tempest Peak, Ruined halfling complex, Lost Dwarven Kingdom of Reknor, Escape from Reknor, Lake of Nur surface, underwater and dry stone grids, Ruined Dungeon, Blighted Ruins, Dark crypt, Golem Graveyard, Ardhungol, Mark of the Spellblaze, Unhallowed Morass, Abashed Expanse, Temporal Rift L1-L4, Murgol Lair, Southern Beach, Tranquil Meadow, Noxious Caldera, Old Conclave Vault, Ruins of Telmur, Elven Ruins, Vor Armoury, Briagh's Lair, Caverns to the hidden valley, Flooded Cave, Temple of Creation, Charred Scar, the Fearscape, Sher'Tul Fortress floors and walls, Rak'shor Pride floors, walls, doors and stairs, and selected stone floors, walls, doors and stairs in both Kor'Pul layouts, and selected town grids in Derth, Lumberjack Town, Last Hope, Elvala, Zigur, Angolwen, Iron Council, Shatur, Point Zero, Gates of Morning and Irkkk, and selected grids in Shadow Crypt, Tannen's Tower, Ithilthum, Valley of the Moon, Ring of Blood, Erúan, Gorbat Pride, High Peak, Grushnak Pride, Slime Tunnels, Sludgenest, Vor Pride, Tutorial, Dreams, and the Temporal Reprieve and Dreamscape planes, including town roads and farmland, levers, lever doors, candles, portals and lava floors. Rhaloren Camp combines forest and stone art on the same level. Blockout supports forest, Norgos' Lair snow-rock, Daikara and Tempest Peak rock and mountain wall, Daikara lava, Heart of the Gloom ground, creep, walls and exits, Sandworm Lair, Ritches Tunnels and Briagh's Lair sand, walls and exits, The Deep Bellow floors, creep, walls and ladders, and Scintillating Caves floors, walls and ladders, and Unremarkable Cave floors, walls and world exit, plus Ardhungol and hidden valley cave floors, walls and ladders, and Mark of the Spellblaze burnt ground, trees, lava and exits, plus void platforms and rift edges, and Lake of Nur, Murgol Lair, Flooded Cave and Temple of Creation underwater floors, walls, doors and stairs, plus Southern Beach, Tranquil Meadow and Noxious Caldera ground, trees, walls, water, props and exits, plus Charred Scar and Fearscape lava floors, lava and rock walls, and Sher'Tul Fortress floors and walls, and Rak'shor Pride floors, walls, doors and stairs; stone cells, including The Maze, keep native art. Unsupported grids keep their native art. Creature tokens use their own setting. Changes take effect immediately and are saved.", "在原版、簡化和精修地形之間切換。精修模式支援巨魔沼澤、古老樹林、斯拉伊什沼澤、羅蘭精靈營地的兩種佈局、恐懼王座、諾爾格斯巢穴的兩種佈局、岱卡拉的兩種佈局、迷宮、黑暗之心、沙蟲巢穴、裏奇通道、深淵咆哮、最後的希望墓地、閃光洞穴、不起眼的洞穴、未知通道、風暴之巔、半身人廢墟、瑞庫納·失落的矮人王國、從瑞庫納逃亡、納爾湖的地表、水下與乾燥石質格、廢棄地城、荒蕪廢墟、黑暗地宮、傀儡墓地、阿爾德胡格、魔法大爆炸之痕、混沌之沼、次元浮島、時空裂隙第一至第四層、穆格爾巢穴、南方海灘、寧靜的草地、劇毒火山、古老的孔克雷夫地下實驗室、泰爾瑪廢墟、精靈廢墟、沃爾軍械庫、布萊亞的巢穴、通往隱祕山谷的山洞、淹沒的洞穴、造物者神廟、灼燒之痕、惡魔空間、夏·圖爾堡壘的地板與牆、拉克·肖部落的地板、牆、門與樓梯，以及卡·普爾廢墟兩種佈局中已支援的石地板、牆、門和樓梯，以及德斯、伐木工人的小村莊、最後的希望、埃爾瓦拉、伊格、安格利文、鋼鐵議會、夏特爾、零點聖域、晨曦之門與伊爾克中已支援的城鎮地格，以及陰影地宮、泰恩之塔、伊塞爾森·月之谷、鮮血之環、艾露安、加伯特部落、巔峰、格魯希納克部落、史萊姆通道、淤泥巢穴、沃爾部落、教程、夢境、時空避難所與夢境空間中已支援的地格，其中包括城鎮道路與農田、拉桿、拉桿門、閱讀蠟燭、傳送門和岩漿地面。羅蘭精靈營地的同一層可同時顯示森林和石質棋盤貼圖。簡化模式支援森林格、諾爾格斯巢穴的雪岩格、岱卡拉與風暴之巔的岩地、山牆，以及岱卡拉的熔岩格、黑暗之心的地面、蔓延地、牆與出口、沙蟲巢穴、裏奇通道與布萊亞的巢穴的沙地、牆與出口、深淵咆哮的地板、蔓延地、牆與梯子，以及閃光洞穴的地板、牆與梯子，以及不起眼的洞穴的地板、牆和世界出口與阿爾德胡格和隱祕山谷山洞的洞穴地板、牆和梯子，以及魔法大爆炸之痕的焦土地面、枯樹、熔岩和出口，以及虛空平台與裂隙邊緣，以及納爾湖、穆格爾巢穴、淹沒的洞穴與造物者神廟的水下地板、牆、門與樓梯，以及南方海灘、寧靜的草地與劇毒火山的地面、樹木、牆、水域、擺設和出口，以及灼燒之痕與惡魔空間的熔岩地面、熔岩和岩牆，以及夏·圖爾堡壘的地板和牆，以及拉克·肖部落的地板、牆、門與樓梯；石質格（包括迷宮）保持原版。未涵蓋的地圖格保持原版。怪物棋子有獨立設定。變更立即生效並儲存。", "_t")
t("Event aura grid", "事件光環地格", "_t")
t("Subtle", "柔和", "_t")
t("Moderate", "適中", "_t")
t("Show a subtle or moderate colored border on supported event aura grids when board terrain is active. Native terrain and unsupported grids keep their original art. Changes take effect immediately and are saved.", "啟用棋盤地形時，在受支援的事件光環地格顯示柔和或適中的彩色邊框。原版地形和未涵蓋的地格保留原有畫面。變更立即生效並儲存。", "_t")
t("Token facing", "棋子朝向", "_t")
t("Fixed", "固定", "_t")
t("Follow movement", "跟隨移動", "_t")
t("Fixed keeps token artwork and its painted light direction unchanged. Follow movement uses native horizontal flipping when moving or attacking. Only covered creature tokens are affected; native appearances keep their own facing. This setting takes effect immediately and is saved. Smooth movement and twitch remain controlled by the native game options.", "固定模式保持棋子圖像和繪製的光照方向不變。跟隨移動模式會在移動或攻擊時使用原版的水平翻轉。只有已涵蓋的怪物棋子受影響；原版外觀仍使用自身的朝向。此設定立即生效並儲存。平滑移動和抖動仍由原版遊戲選項控制。", "_t")
t("Rare", "稀有", "_t")
t("Unique", "獨特", "_t")
t("Boss", "首領", "_t")
t("Elite boss", "精英首領", "_t")
t("God", "神祇", "_t")
t("Change this rank badge color. Adjust the RGB sliders and preview the badge, then choose Apply. Colors are saved for future games. Normal and elite creatures remain unmarked.", "修改此等級徽記的顏色。調整 RGB 滑桿並預覽徽記，然後選擇「套用」。顏色會儲存供以後遊戲使用。普通和精英怪物仍不顯示徽記。", "_t")
t("Friendly ring", "友方圓環", "_t")
t("Neutral ring", "中立圓環", "_t")
t("Hostile ring", "敵方圓環", "_t")
t("Change the faction outline and health arc together. The player keeps a cyan ring with a white inner line. Friendly units have a solid outline, neutral units a dashed outline, and hostile units four notches. Shields remain pearl white.", "同時修改陣營輪廓和生命弧線。玩家保持青色圓環和白色內線；友方為實線輪廓，中立為虛線輪廓，敵方有四道缺口。護盾保持珍珠白。", "_t")
t("Restore default colors", "恢復預設顏色", "_t")
t("Restore warm rank badges and the default green friendly, blue neutral and red hostile rings. The player keeps its cyan ring and white inner line. Shields remain pearl white.", "恢復暖色等級徽記，以及預設的友方綠色、中立藍色和敵方紅色圓環。玩家保持青色圓環和白色內線，護盾保持珍珠白。", "_t")
t("Reset all", "全部重設", "_t")
t("Color", "顏色", "_t")
t("Adjust red, green and blue. Apply saves this color; Cancel keeps your current color.", "調整紅、綠、藍三色。「套用」儲存新顏色；「取消」保留目前顏色。", "_t")
t("Apply", "套用", "_t")
t("Default", "預設", "_t")
t("Cancel", "取消", "_t")
t("R: ", "紅：", "_t")
t("G: ", "綠：", "_t")
t("B: ", "藍：", "_t")
t("RGB %d, %d, %d", "RGB %d，%d，%d", "tformat")
t("RGB %d, %d, %d     Hex %02X%02X%02X", "RGB %d，%d，%d     十六進位 %02X%02X%02X", "tformat")
